Subject: [PATCH 2/8] ub:ubctl:Supports the configuration and query of packet
 statistics on the UBOE interface based on the NL-layer VL.

tool inclusion
category: bugfix
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubctl/issues/19
CVE: NA

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Supports the configuration and query of packet statistics on the UBOE
interface based on the NL-layer VL.

Signed-off-by: Jiaqi Cheng <chengjiaqi3@huawei.com>
